    "catalogue_description": "My second nazi zombie map \u201cForce\u201d is a small map that is pretty detailed. I\u2019ve been working on it on and off for 3 months or so and I think I finally have it finished. *It does support co-op but I haven\u2019t been able to test it\u2026 Honestly it\u2019s small so I tend to think of it more as a solo map. Features- *No DOGS!!! *Weapons Box *Power/Perk machines *Buyable and FREE weapons *Buyable ending *Hours of FUN I know it\u2019s not some crazy modded map but it was really fun to make and it\u2019s really fun to play! Here\u2019s some pics(if anyone feels like making a video for me that would be cool!) Thanks!! Xo Grant Xo dance1",
